WEBVTT

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:12.680
[screaming]

00:00:35.327 --> 00:00:37.746
[theme music playing]

00:02:28.190 --> 00:02:29.900
[Yusuf] The troops are quartered.

00:02:29.983 --> 00:02:34.988
Burial preparations are underway
for those we were able to retrieve.

00:02:35.072 --> 00:02:39.617
I have ordered scouting parties to sweep
the grasslands a week's ride away

00:02:39.702 --> 00:02:41.286
in case Sidao is...

00:02:42.204 --> 00:02:45.082
audacious enough
to siege Cambulac.

00:02:47.668 --> 00:02:51.504
Finally, we are conscripting
new troops from the north.

00:02:51.588 --> 00:02:53.548
I have begun preparations for training.

00:02:53.631 --> 00:02:56.384
I fear they may be less compliant now,

00:02:56.468 --> 00:02:59.972
but we shall do what is necessary
to bend the willful.

00:03:03.892 --> 00:03:05.268
My Lord.

00:03:07.645 --> 00:03:09.272
Is that truly all?

00:03:12.567 --> 00:03:15.153
Do you not wish to discuss your counsel?

00:03:16.154 --> 00:03:18.198
And my disregard of it?

00:03:26.832 --> 00:03:30.335
The Polo matter,
are you prepared to proceed?

00:03:55.693 --> 00:03:57.738
[Yusuf] Master Marco,

00:03:57.821 --> 00:04:00.407
in his infinite wisdom and compassion,

00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:06.121
the Khan of Khans grants you
a final audience to plead for mercy.

00:04:15.756 --> 00:04:18.175
[Marco] I will not plead for mercy.

00:04:19.009 --> 00:04:20.844
But I will defend myself.

00:04:22.595 --> 00:04:25.891
May I seek clarity as to
the charges levied against me?

00:04:25.974 --> 00:04:27.350
[Jingim] Treason.

00:04:40.363 --> 00:04:42.449
[Ahmad] I take no pleasure in this,
Master Marco.

00:04:42.532 --> 00:04:44.827
But it seems great misfortune

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:47.662
has descended upon our kingdom
on your arrival.

00:04:47.745 --> 00:04:49.957
I did not choose to remain here.

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:51.917
I chose to be released to my father.

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:54.211
[Ahmad] Your time in the Kochkor region.

00:04:54.294 --> 00:04:57.380
Your ability to enter and leave
without repercussion.

00:04:57.464 --> 00:04:59.674
And do you suspect Byamba,
son of the Khan,

00:04:59.757 --> 00:05:01.468
to have blood on his hands?

00:05:01.551 --> 00:05:03.761
We traveled side by side.

00:05:05.305 --> 00:05:06.890
Is that accurate, Byamba?

00:05:06.974 --> 00:05:09.517
Were you always at the Latin's side
on your journey?

00:05:09.601 --> 00:05:12.270
I was asked to be here and I came.

00:05:12.354 --> 00:05:14.940
But you cannot compel me
to be party to this.

00:05:15.023 --> 00:05:16.649
[grunts sharply]

00:05:20.653 --> 00:05:24.074
No, we were not side by side.

00:05:26.034 --> 00:05:28.703
There was a point where
he was negotiating for my life

00:05:28.786 --> 00:05:32.082
while I sat captive,
preparing to die.

00:05:33.208 --> 00:05:36.879
And if I remember,
you sent the Latin with me on my journey.

00:05:36.962 --> 00:05:38.964
After he convinced me to do so.

00:05:39.047 --> 00:05:41.549
How does your body
stand straight without a spine?

00:05:41.633 --> 00:05:43.635
[Ahmad] Xiangyang.

00:05:45.387 --> 00:05:46.721
The loss.

00:05:46.804 --> 00:05:48.806
Your journey there.

00:05:48.891 --> 00:05:50.767
Your time with the whore's whore-friend.

00:05:52.602 --> 00:05:54.854
Sanctioned by the Khan of Khans.

00:05:54.938 --> 00:05:56.564
You alerted the Song
to our pending attack.

00:05:56.648 --> 00:05:59.067
You conspired to lead us
into the slaughter.

00:05:59.151 --> 00:06:01.861
What need would they of warning?

00:06:03.405 --> 00:06:06.366
They knew we were descending
at a week's distance.

00:06:07.951 --> 00:06:09.912
As to the wall...

00:06:09.995 --> 00:06:11.496
I am guilty.

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:17.835
I founder in the blood of the thousands
who perished for my error.

00:06:19.004 --> 00:06:21.048
I have no defense.

00:06:24.759 --> 00:06:30.515
But right or wrong, I have done nothing
but serve my captor and Khan.

00:06:32.767 --> 00:06:34.061
And only him?

00:06:37.981 --> 00:06:39.232
Yes.

00:06:44.571 --> 00:06:46.073
Is that all?

00:06:47.115 --> 00:06:51.119
Nothing you have presented is punishable
by the laws of the Khan of Khans.

00:06:54.247 --> 00:06:56.041
[Jingim] I had this translated.

00:07:00.212 --> 00:07:02.130
Would you care to share with the Khan

00:07:02.214 --> 00:07:05.592
the words that you keep
so closely to your still-beating heart?

00:07:08.428 --> 00:07:11.431
"All kings shall fall before him."

00:07:12.849 --> 00:07:17.104
[Jingim] "All kings...
shall fall before him."

00:07:17.187 --> 00:07:18.521
It was a gift.

00:07:18.605 --> 00:07:20.107
[Jingim] From father to son?

00:07:20.190 --> 00:07:21.733
[Marco] Yes.

00:07:21.816 --> 00:07:26.821
A verse from the scriptures of a religion
welcomed, like all the others,

00:07:26.904 --> 00:07:28.615
within the walls of Cambulac.

00:07:28.698 --> 00:07:30.951
A faith with designs on our kingdom.

00:07:31.034 --> 00:07:32.995
I know nothing of that.

00:07:34.746 --> 00:07:37.790
But I do believe
you have designs on the Vatican.

00:07:37.874 --> 00:07:39.209
What of it?

00:07:40.961 --> 00:07:44.047
Respectfully, Lord Khan...

00:07:44.131 --> 00:07:45.757
we reap what we sow.

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:47.342
You speak recklessly.

00:07:47.425 --> 00:07:49.052
I speak honestly.

00:07:50.053 --> 00:07:53.098
You deserve honesty.

00:07:53.181 --> 00:07:56.809
You believe I should not conquer the West?

00:07:58.103 --> 00:08:01.023
On the contrary, Lord Khan.

00:08:02.565 --> 00:08:05.986
The most common law
of nature and of man...

00:08:07.112 --> 00:08:10.865
is to take what has been mandated

00:08:10.948 --> 00:08:12.409
by God

00:08:12.492 --> 00:08:15.412
or by the swords and arrows you command.

00:08:16.413 --> 00:08:18.581
You claim both.

00:08:18.665 --> 00:08:22.460
But you must be prepared
for the resistance of the lionhearted.

00:08:23.378 --> 00:08:25.880
And the West is not weak.

00:08:38.935 --> 00:08:42.522
Have you nothing more to say
to champion your cause?

00:08:44.232 --> 00:08:48.695
It seems my end is guaranteed
no matter what words I sound.

00:08:49.946 --> 00:08:51.239
Indeed.

00:08:55.327 --> 00:08:56.369
Mmm.

00:09:54.969 --> 00:09:56.221
[inhaling]

00:10:02.727 --> 00:10:05.730
The Imperial Seal is yours, Chancellor.

00:10:05.813 --> 00:10:08.065
And with it, the dynasty.

00:10:10.152 --> 00:10:13.070
Chancellor... even still?

00:10:13.155 --> 00:10:15.615
Unless your birthright has altered.

00:10:18.993 --> 00:10:20.912
The Seven Families are arriving.

00:10:20.995 --> 00:10:24.499
Songs of your victory
have carried far and wide.

00:10:24.582 --> 00:10:28.753
How you eviscerated the Mongol horde,
body and soul.

00:10:30.338 --> 00:10:33.925
They are prepared
to pledge their fealty to the Emperor.

00:10:36.136 --> 00:10:38.346
They're going to want to see the boy.

00:10:39.431 --> 00:10:41.516
That is assured.

00:10:41.599 --> 00:10:44.894
[Jia Sidao] No one truly believes
the boy guides his own hand.

00:10:46.479 --> 00:10:48.773
Yet the sheep elevate him.

00:10:51.025 --> 00:10:52.944
I must stand behind him.

00:10:53.027 --> 00:10:54.779
A wise tactic, my Chancellor.

00:10:57.574 --> 00:11:01.077
I suppose I couldn't simply
imprint this on his skull

00:11:01.161 --> 00:11:02.870
and float him down the Yangtze?

00:11:08.418 --> 00:11:10.086
[Kokachin] Tell me your name.

00:11:11.045 --> 00:11:12.797
You need not fear me.

00:11:12.880 --> 00:11:15.800
It is Judar, my Princess.

00:11:17.176 --> 00:11:18.803
You may call me Kokachin.

00:11:19.929 --> 00:11:21.431
No, Princess.

00:11:21.514 --> 00:11:22.640
Do you defy me?

00:11:24.100 --> 00:11:26.060
In this, I do.

00:11:27.019 --> 00:11:29.689
If you defy this simple request,

00:11:29.772 --> 00:11:32.400
how am I to know
you will not defy a greater one?

00:11:32.484 --> 00:11:36.070
The truest of servants
knows our needs better than we do.

00:11:36.153 --> 00:11:37.697
Leave us.

00:11:41.493 --> 00:11:44.996
I was your age
when I was promised to Kublai.

00:11:45.079 --> 00:11:46.998
It was terrifying.

00:11:47.081 --> 00:11:51.503
I knew he would be Khan
even if he himself did not.

00:11:52.879 --> 00:11:56.841
At the time...
I felt as if I was unworthy,

00:11:56.924 --> 00:11:59.176
that a mistake had surely been made

00:11:59.261 --> 00:12:02.847
and at a moment's notice
someone would unveil me as a fraud.

00:12:06.309 --> 00:12:09.646
It was not until Kublai's mother
gifted me this,

00:12:09.729 --> 00:12:13.858
the finest of silks, to be woven
into my presentational gown,

00:12:13.941 --> 00:12:16.110
that I knew it was true.

00:12:16.193 --> 00:12:20.573
I kept what remained
to one day gift to a daughter of my own.

00:12:26.996 --> 00:12:28.748
It is lovely.

00:12:28.831 --> 00:12:32.335
A mere reflection of the beauty
who wears it.

00:12:35.212 --> 00:12:40.718
I also come to pay condolences
and to inquire as to your heart.

00:12:43.346 --> 00:12:45.139
I lost a good friend.

00:12:45.222 --> 00:12:48.726
Your only friend, if I recall.

00:12:50.395 --> 00:12:52.897
I hope it's no longer the case,
my Queen.

00:12:54.316 --> 00:12:55.942
If you speak of me...

00:12:57.569 --> 00:12:59.446
speak with certainty.

00:13:04.576 --> 00:13:08.496
I'm afraid loss has infected
the kingdom of late.

00:13:09.747 --> 00:13:12.124
With more on the horizon.

00:13:14.168 --> 00:13:16.212
So I've heard.

00:13:16.295 --> 00:13:18.340
You've heard?

00:13:20.592 --> 00:13:23.302
The Latin is to be executed.

00:13:28.808 --> 00:13:29.976
At dawn.

00:13:31.143 --> 00:13:34.230
A seamstress will pay you a visit shortly.

00:13:36.691 --> 00:13:39.777
[sighs deeply]

00:13:40.945 --> 00:13:42.905
[Jingim] Master Polo.

00:13:42.989 --> 00:13:45.783
I came to inquire
as to your state of mind.

00:13:47.535 --> 00:13:50.455
My thanks for your concern, Jingim.

00:13:50.538 --> 00:13:51.748
Prince.

00:13:52.832 --> 00:13:54.709
[Marco] Prince Jingim.

00:13:55.793 --> 00:13:56.919
[snickers]

00:13:59.255 --> 00:14:01.424
[Jingim] I know this seems unjust,

00:14:01.508 --> 00:14:04.552
and it's hard for you to see,
sitting where you are.

00:14:05.928 --> 00:14:11.017
But understand... that this is entirely
for the good of the kingdom.

00:14:15.772 --> 00:14:17.189
Do you hunt?

00:14:19.692 --> 00:14:24.864
In our culture, your first hunt,
as in many things in life,

00:14:24.947 --> 00:14:27.324
is a very lonely enterprise.

00:14:28.951 --> 00:14:33.289
You're cast into the wilderness
with nothing more than a bow and an arrow

00:14:33.373 --> 00:14:36.208
and instructed not to return without meat.

00:14:37.544 --> 00:14:39.003
For the kingdom.

00:14:40.004 --> 00:14:43.257
It can take a day, a week.

00:14:44.341 --> 00:14:46.386
Some never return.

00:14:51.808 --> 00:14:56.062
What do you think is the most vital trait
for the hunter to possess?

00:14:56.145 --> 00:14:59.732
Please, Jingim,
do not mar my final hours.

00:15:02.234 --> 00:15:03.653
Patience.

00:15:07.532 --> 00:15:10.242
I saw its horns first.

00:15:10.326 --> 00:15:14.831
Grand, stretching to the heavens
and catching the morning light.

00:15:15.832 --> 00:15:17.542
A mighty trophy.

00:15:19.627 --> 00:15:23.047
I set my arrow, took aim.

00:15:24.674 --> 00:15:25.842
He was gone.

00:15:29.929 --> 00:15:32.223
But I had a feeling about him...

00:15:33.182 --> 00:15:35.435
and so I waited another night.

00:15:36.478 --> 00:15:40.397
It was so cold,
I wanted to run home.

00:15:40.482 --> 00:15:44.026
A handful of kills passed me by.

00:15:44.110 --> 00:15:47.905
I could have slain them all,
returned triumphant,

00:15:47.989 --> 00:15:50.658
dipped my finger in the fat of the kill,

00:15:50.742 --> 00:15:53.911
been deemed a man
and slept in my own bed.

00:15:56.998 --> 00:15:58.708
But I waited.

00:16:02.545 --> 00:16:05.632
As I felt the sun warm me
the next morning...

00:16:08.092 --> 00:16:11.929
there it was,
passing between the trees.

00:16:16.893 --> 00:16:18.978
My father was so proud.

00:16:39.624 --> 00:16:41.083
Patience.

00:16:43.085 --> 00:16:46.589
Patience to ensure that
true aim finds the true target.

00:16:48.215 --> 00:16:50.217
An innocent target,

00:16:50.301 --> 00:16:54.346
whose offense was crossing paths
at the wrong time,

00:16:55.640 --> 00:16:57.183
with the wrong person.

00:17:15.492 --> 00:17:16.619
Death.

00:17:18.120 --> 00:17:19.831
Another lonely enterprise.

00:17:22.667 --> 00:17:25.753
May your God accompany you,
Master Polo.

00:17:31.718 --> 00:17:33.720
You will need it more than I.

00:17:42.687 --> 00:17:45.815
[Jia Sidao] Let us not build strife
where none should exist.

00:17:45.898 --> 00:17:48.359
Pride and hope have filled
the coffers of the people's spirits.

00:17:48.442 --> 00:17:51.528
Those coffers were never depleted.

00:17:51.613 --> 00:17:55.575
You simply convinced yourself otherwise
to support your own machinations.

00:17:55.658 --> 00:17:57.118
[Jia Sidao] Why am I your enemy

00:17:57.201 --> 00:18:01.581
when you're the one prepared to bury
our culture in history's potter's field?

00:18:01.664 --> 00:18:04.416
The landed gentry of the south
prepare to meet.

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:07.294
Are these the same landed gentry
whose land you stripped

00:18:07.378 --> 00:18:09.546
against my husband's wishes
not long ago?

00:18:09.631 --> 00:18:13.259
The proceeds from the fields
helped fund our defenses.

00:18:13.342 --> 00:18:16.428
And each now pledges their support
for an assault on Cambulac.

00:18:16.512 --> 00:18:19.599
My compliments, Jia Sidao.

00:18:19.682 --> 00:18:21.100
[Jia Sidao] Insincerity still.

00:18:21.183 --> 00:18:23.394
I am nothing but sincere.

00:18:23.477 --> 00:18:28.524
You set out to undermine the council
and retain the chancellorate.

00:18:28.608 --> 00:18:29.859
Fang Zhen fell.

00:18:31.193 --> 00:18:33.529
You sought to repel the Mongol horde

00:18:33.613 --> 00:18:37.992
and masterfully lured them into
a hornet's nest of sharpened steel.

00:18:38.075 --> 00:18:42.997
You wish to gather Southern China
into one indomitable force

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:46.042
and gird them for the final unification.

00:18:46.125 --> 00:18:48.961
I have no doubt
you will succeed in that as well.

00:18:49.045 --> 00:18:53.675
But you will do so without the support
you are about to ask of me.

00:18:53.758 --> 00:18:56.427
How might I convince you
of the folly of your decision?

00:18:56.510 --> 00:18:58.304
Stop tinkering with that
and look at me.

00:19:03.017 --> 00:19:05.519
There is nothing
you might say or do.

00:19:05.602 --> 00:19:06.813
Ever.

00:19:08.773 --> 00:19:11.275
I assumed that
would be your answer.

00:19:11.358 --> 00:19:12.401
Very well.

00:19:12.484 --> 00:19:16.155
I shall go it alone.
Yet again.

00:19:16.238 --> 00:19:20.284
[Empress Dowager] You need the Emperor
in order to accomplish your final design.

00:19:20.367 --> 00:19:23.579
You cannot lock me
away from him forever.

00:19:23.663 --> 00:19:25.122
[Jia Sidao] My dear Empress...

00:19:26.332 --> 00:19:28.334
I never considered that an option.

00:19:31.713 --> 00:19:34.048
-[gun fires]
-[body thudding]

00:19:38.094 --> 00:19:40.096
[grunting]

00:19:58.405 --> 00:20:01.075
You're here to defend him?

00:20:01.158 --> 00:20:05.121
Lord Khan, years ago,
you took my eyes.

00:20:05.204 --> 00:20:09.291
Today... I offer you the rest of me.

00:20:09.375 --> 00:20:11.418
What do you speak of?

00:20:11.502 --> 00:20:15.172
If the boy is culpable as you say,

00:20:15.256 --> 00:20:19.969
and I have no reason to doubt
the Khan's good judgment on such matters,

00:20:20.052 --> 00:20:22.972
then I am equally culpable.

00:20:23.055 --> 00:20:25.599
You entrusted the Latin to me.

00:20:25.682 --> 00:20:28.853
I trained him, fought beside him.

00:20:28.936 --> 00:20:31.272
How can you not
believe me complicit?

00:20:31.355 --> 00:20:32.774
-Get out!
-Lord Khan--

00:20:32.857 --> 00:20:36.485
Guards!
Escort the monk out of my sight.

00:20:36.568 --> 00:20:39.071
Do not allow him to return.

00:21:02.553 --> 00:21:04.721
-Where do you intend to go?
-The Ministry of Justice.

00:21:04.806 --> 00:21:06.849
-For what purpose?
-None of your concern.

00:21:09.476 --> 00:21:12.188
My apologies,
but you may not leave, Princess.

00:21:12.271 --> 00:21:13.856
Pardon me?

00:21:13.940 --> 00:21:15.399
I cannot allow you to leave.

00:21:15.482 --> 00:21:16.776
You're my servant.

00:21:16.859 --> 00:21:19.028
As well as your defender.

00:21:20.279 --> 00:21:21.655
Whom do you take orders from?

00:21:21.738 --> 00:21:25.159
The Blue Princess commands me
as dictated by the Great Khan.

00:21:25.242 --> 00:21:28.037
You had best remember that.

00:21:28.120 --> 00:21:29.455
Stand aside!

00:21:37.546 --> 00:21:41.550
Empress Chabi has instructed
that you remain in your quarters.

00:21:43.469 --> 00:21:46.513
-Until?
-We receive further orders.

00:22:16.377 --> 00:22:17.503
Hello, Ling Ling.

00:22:20.882 --> 00:22:26.345
I appreciate your regard, child,
but sit with me.

00:22:32.268 --> 00:22:34.770
You're beyond your years
in grace and training.

00:22:35.980 --> 00:22:39.858
Regrettably, that is found
far too infrequently in children your age.

00:22:39.942 --> 00:22:42.904
My thanks, My Lady.

00:22:42.987 --> 00:22:44.488
When I was a young girl,

00:22:44.571 --> 00:22:48.825
my mother told me it was as if
I had been raised by wild yaks,

00:22:48.910 --> 00:22:51.620
spitting and kicking
everyone around me.

00:22:55.124 --> 00:22:56.750
How are you feeling?

00:22:58.419 --> 00:23:00.922
My feet hurt less, My Lady.

00:23:01.880 --> 00:23:03.757
Good news.

00:23:05.009 --> 00:23:07.094
How are you finding
your time in Cambulac?

00:23:07.178 --> 00:23:09.180
I enjoy it greatly.

00:23:11.390 --> 00:23:14.226
You miss your home?
Your family?

00:23:18.272 --> 00:23:19.690
Tell me of your mother.

00:23:21.108 --> 00:23:24.736
To have a daughter such as yourself,
she must be lovely.

00:23:25.737 --> 00:23:28.324
She is. She's a dancer.

00:23:31.285 --> 00:23:32.494
A dancer?

00:23:33.495 --> 00:23:35.414
Does she dance for you?

00:23:35.497 --> 00:23:36.999
For my father.

00:23:38.417 --> 00:23:41.545
I am quite sure he enjoys that.

00:23:41.628 --> 00:23:44.256
She was his favorite.

00:23:47.676 --> 00:23:48.970
His favorite?

00:23:52.264 --> 00:23:55.184
Did your father
have many dancers?

00:24:05.111 --> 00:24:06.820
Does your father still live?

00:24:12.493 --> 00:24:15.997
Did your father sit on a throne?

00:24:19.416 --> 00:24:21.043
[Ahmad] <i>We own Chinese royalty?</i>

00:24:21.835 --> 00:24:25.797
That's more precious than anything
that surrounds us in this moment.

00:24:25.881 --> 00:24:27.883
The question is,
how best to use it?

00:24:27.966 --> 00:24:30.386
We own nothing.

00:24:30.469 --> 00:24:33.930
The daughter rightfully does not trust me.
The mother less so.

00:24:34.015 --> 00:24:37.018
Her mother's like a wounded animal,
desperate for kindness.

00:24:37.101 --> 00:24:41.480
One which will lick your hand
simply to get a taste before biting.

00:24:41.563 --> 00:24:44.233
Some men pay good coin
for such pleasures.

00:24:45.734 --> 00:24:48.737
I wonder sometimes
about that mind of yours.

00:24:48.820 --> 00:24:51.407
Clear in intent, Lady Empress.

00:24:52.408 --> 00:24:54.868
Then be intent on this matter.

00:24:55.494 --> 00:25:00.624
To tame an animal,
it must fear the raising of your hand.

00:25:00.707 --> 00:25:02.793
I may be just ahead of you
at this moment.

00:25:04.961 --> 00:25:06.172
How so?

00:25:06.255 --> 00:25:08.507
I planted a seed in the mother's head

00:25:08.590 --> 00:25:10.801
that her daughter is...

00:25:10.884 --> 00:25:13.845
closer than she first envisioned.

00:25:13.929 --> 00:25:16.265
I imagine it may have
sprouted as a weed.

00:25:16.348 --> 00:25:17.474
Hmm.

00:25:30.946 --> 00:25:33.532
[Marco] I value your friendship, Sifu.

00:25:34.575 --> 00:25:38.704
As I have stated time and again,
I am not your friend.

00:25:38.787 --> 00:25:40.747
Far from it.

00:25:40.831 --> 00:25:43.334
I know you wish to believe that,

00:25:43.417 --> 00:25:47.671
but you cared for me,
taught me, protected me.

00:25:48.797 --> 00:25:51.550
What would you call that,
if not friendship?

00:25:51.633 --> 00:25:53.427
An onerous burden.

00:25:55.304 --> 00:25:58.182
In few hours' time,
that burden will be lifted.

00:25:59.516 --> 00:26:02.478
[Hundred Eyes]
And I will have lost a friend.

00:26:02.561 --> 00:26:04.480
[Marco] Is there no escape?

00:26:04.563 --> 00:26:06.648
[Hundred Eyes]
From you leaving this mortal body?

00:26:07.774 --> 00:26:09.067
[Marco] Yes.

00:26:09.151 --> 00:26:10.527
[Hundred Eyes] None.

00:26:10.611 --> 00:26:12.863
Unless you can find
something to gift to him

00:26:12.946 --> 00:26:15.657
that is more valuable than your life.

00:26:17.201 --> 00:26:19.328
[thunder rumbling]

00:26:50.442 --> 00:26:51.610
[Zhao Xian] Why?

00:26:51.693 --> 00:26:53.945
[Jia Sidao]
She missed your father so much.

00:26:54.029 --> 00:26:59.201
Sometimes, hearts are broken
and they cannot be pieced together again.

00:26:59.285 --> 00:27:01.370
Will mine break?

00:27:01.453 --> 00:27:04.456
No... because you do not need her.

00:27:05.332 --> 00:27:09.836
You do not need me or anyone.
You need only this.

00:27:17.636 --> 00:27:18.804
What do you see?

00:27:20.181 --> 00:27:21.390
A bug.

00:27:21.473 --> 00:27:24.810
You're most correct,
but it is so much more.

00:27:24.893 --> 00:27:26.895
This mantis that I give to you

00:27:27.729 --> 00:27:31.442
was one of 300 nymphs, babies...

00:27:31.525 --> 00:27:32.734
about this big.

00:27:33.444 --> 00:27:35.654
Imagine that, 300.

00:27:35.737 --> 00:27:38.657
The strongest among them
kill the weakest among them

00:27:39.325 --> 00:27:41.159
until the very best are left.

00:27:41.243 --> 00:27:42.661
A mere handful.

00:27:43.662 --> 00:27:47.791
Now, this mantis will leave this life
within 10 months of today.

00:27:50.001 --> 00:27:53.797
You must take this time as an opportunity
to learn everything you can.

00:27:53.880 --> 00:27:56.091
To study, to practice,

00:27:56.174 --> 00:27:59.135
to absorb all the lessons of the mantis,

00:27:59.220 --> 00:28:00.304
for there are many.

00:28:00.387 --> 00:28:05.183
Patience, speed,
adaptability, ruthlessness.

00:28:05.892 --> 00:28:08.019
The traits of a warrior king.

00:28:09.145 --> 00:28:10.814
Heed my words, my Emperor...

00:28:12.023 --> 00:28:14.443
and you will become as the mantis.

00:28:31.502 --> 00:28:32.711
[Kokachin] Judar?

00:28:33.795 --> 00:28:35.256
Yes, Princess?

00:28:37.466 --> 00:28:40.761
Fetch me some sandalwood
for my bath.

00:28:40.844 --> 00:28:42.679
Yes, Princess.

00:29:01.240 --> 00:29:02.574
[gasps]

00:29:05.952 --> 00:29:08.830
[panting]

00:29:32.271 --> 00:29:33.689
What are your thoughts?

00:29:35.691 --> 00:29:37.484
I do not know.

00:29:42.614 --> 00:29:43.990
Is it my doing?

00:29:45.284 --> 00:29:47.035
Are you frustrated with me?

00:29:47.118 --> 00:29:49.955
No. No, never.

00:29:54.125 --> 00:29:55.752
I need you here.

00:30:01.383 --> 00:30:02.468
I am.

00:30:07.889 --> 00:30:09.975
Why am I not relieved?

00:30:13.186 --> 00:30:18.024
You are sensitive to the grief of others,
no matter their transgressions.

00:30:19.443 --> 00:30:22.738
Every breath the Latin takes
is a burden on your soul.

00:30:24.490 --> 00:30:29.244
At sun's light... you will find relief.

00:30:44.593 --> 00:30:47.137
Did I introduce a curse
into our bed?

00:30:50.932 --> 00:30:53.519
You are the son of a Khan...

00:30:55.020 --> 00:30:57.523
a Khan in waiting.

00:30:59.816 --> 00:31:03.278
The fault rests with me
and me alone.

00:31:13.288 --> 00:31:15.666
[door opening]

00:31:25.967 --> 00:31:28.762
[Chabi] Do not make your presence known.

00:31:31.723 --> 00:31:35.727
I wanted you to see that she lives.
As you wished.

00:31:36.895 --> 00:31:38.939
She will always be here,

00:31:39.022 --> 00:31:42.401
under my watchful eye,
under my tutelage.

00:31:43.444 --> 00:31:45.696
I will care for her as my own.

00:31:51.076 --> 00:31:52.118
[gasps]

00:31:52.202 --> 00:31:55.497
Look at her, remember her.

00:31:56.707 --> 00:31:58.083
You will never see her again.

00:32:00.126 --> 00:32:03.464
But if you do what I say,
when I say it,

00:32:03.547 --> 00:32:08.343
you can be secure in the knowledge that
her days will stretch long before her.

00:32:19.187 --> 00:32:20.439
Come now.

00:32:45.296 --> 00:32:47.716
What is the benefit
of being a princess

00:32:47.799 --> 00:32:51.094
if your lord requires you
to perform your own labor?

00:32:51.177 --> 00:32:54.055
We will do the same
to our children one day.

00:32:55.056 --> 00:32:56.642
Where are your belongings?

00:32:57.476 --> 00:33:02.063
I looked for what I should pack
and realized everything I need is here.

00:33:04.065 --> 00:33:06.485
In a week's time, we will be home.

00:33:09.404 --> 00:33:11.782
Is this as foreign to you
as it is to me?

00:33:11.865 --> 00:33:13.158
More so.

00:33:14.409 --> 00:33:16.662
Do you think we will ever settle into it?

00:33:16.745 --> 00:33:18.413
I hope not.

00:33:42.979 --> 00:33:44.397
Minister.

00:33:58.537 --> 00:34:01.206
Is this what you
summoned me down here for?

00:34:01.289 --> 00:34:03.374
You oversee war.

00:34:04.793 --> 00:34:07.588
And I am going to tell you how to win it.

00:34:10.423 --> 00:34:12.217
Thank you for coming.

00:34:13.426 --> 00:34:16.387
Do you think I would deny
a dying man an audience?

00:34:16.471 --> 00:34:18.223
I know nothing of you.

00:34:18.306 --> 00:34:21.476
In this, you are at a decided advantage.

00:34:23.228 --> 00:34:24.229
Your journal.

00:34:25.606 --> 00:34:27.273
It is most enlightening

00:34:27.357 --> 00:34:31.570
when one has unfettered access
inside a person's thoughts.

00:34:33.029 --> 00:34:35.323
Warrantless access.

00:34:35.406 --> 00:34:37.701
To be fair, you were an enigma.

00:34:38.702 --> 00:34:40.579
One that had grown close to my Khan.

00:34:40.662 --> 00:34:44.583
You could have sat with me
prior to my last night of life...

00:34:44.666 --> 00:34:45.834
and asked.

00:34:47.418 --> 00:34:51.715
I am certain you would not have granted me
the insight I required.

00:34:53.925 --> 00:34:54.926
But...

00:34:56.136 --> 00:34:57.345
I procured the journal

00:34:57.428 --> 00:35:00.265
prior to your writing of one curiosity.

00:35:01.266 --> 00:35:04.144
What made you cease
your attempts at escape?

00:35:05.729 --> 00:35:07.063
Was it her?

00:35:12.568 --> 00:35:16.948
Under the circumstances,
you need not hold your tongue.

00:35:22.453 --> 00:35:23.830
Partially.

00:35:25.498 --> 00:35:27.125
Significantly.

00:35:28.752 --> 00:35:30.754
But not entirely.

00:35:39.554 --> 00:35:40.681
Tell me.

00:35:48.229 --> 00:35:50.649
The walled Phoenician city of Tyre.

00:35:51.900 --> 00:35:54.653
It defied Alexander for 13 long years.

00:35:56.780 --> 00:35:59.908
Built on an island,
Tyre was walled to the sea,

00:35:59.991 --> 00:36:03.578
an insurmountable fortress
that was key to all of Persia.

00:36:03.662 --> 00:36:07.332
He attempted to breach the walls
using common instruments of war,

00:36:07.415 --> 00:36:11.419
arrows, battering rams, catapults.

00:36:11.502 --> 00:36:15.882
But three dozen men
are needed to load and fire one.

00:36:17.968 --> 00:36:22.931
Alexander employed... the trebuchet,

00:36:23.014 --> 00:36:27.978
a siege engine powered not by men
but by a counterweight.

00:36:28.729 --> 00:36:32.315
Imagine the weight of
6,000 pounds on one end

00:36:32.398 --> 00:36:34.985
and a 300-pound rock set on the other.

00:36:36.402 --> 00:36:39.990
Imagine firing 1,000 in a single day.

00:36:45.495 --> 00:36:51.001
Imagine what even three of these engines
could do to the walls of Xiangyang.

00:36:52.085 --> 00:36:56.422
And at a distance that keeps
the army safe from archers.

00:36:56.506 --> 00:36:57.758
Correct.

00:37:02.178 --> 00:37:04.055
Altruism still?

00:37:05.056 --> 00:37:08.309
Even in the face of your execution?

00:37:08.393 --> 00:37:09.770
Not purely.

00:37:11.396 --> 00:37:13.189
I'm not afraid to die...

00:37:14.399 --> 00:37:18.611
but I'm terrified to do so
while branded a traitor.

00:37:25.368 --> 00:37:27.996
What is the entirety you spoke of earlier?

00:37:29.414 --> 00:37:31.207
What else made you stay?

00:37:35.545 --> 00:37:39.883
The moment the Khan gave me the choice
to deliver my father from death.

00:37:41.384 --> 00:37:43.804
He is a good man.

00:38:02.781 --> 00:38:06.326
Grandfather, why couldn't
you have taken that?

00:38:06.409 --> 00:38:09.620
Why couldn't you have taken that wall?

00:38:33.686 --> 00:38:37.773
My Emperor, these men
are all that remain of the Red Lotus.

00:38:37.858 --> 00:38:40.986
Traitors within the kingdom determined
to undermine the Emperor's mission,

00:38:41.611 --> 00:38:44.780
determined to destroy
the Emperor and his dynasty.

00:38:44.865 --> 00:38:47.868
They are your enemy.

00:38:47.951 --> 00:38:50.495
They are weak.
They must be punished.

00:38:52.455 --> 00:38:56.209
What does the strong mantis do
to its weaker brothers and sisters?

00:38:59.712 --> 00:39:01.214
Kill them.

00:39:01.923 --> 00:39:03.049
[Jia Sidao] Hmm.

00:39:09.555 --> 00:39:10.932
A catapult?

00:39:11.933 --> 00:39:13.393
Waste of my time.

00:39:14.394 --> 00:39:18.189
Lord Khan, with respect,
this may very well be the key--

00:39:18.273 --> 00:39:21.109
[Kublai] The key to Xiangyang, finally!

00:39:22.152 --> 00:39:26.447
If only my Vice Regent
had attained this key years ago!

00:39:26.531 --> 00:39:28.158
Some magical solution?

00:39:28.241 --> 00:39:32.120
Why did you bring this to me
when I know you crave my failure?

00:39:32.203 --> 00:39:34.414
If that is what you believe,

00:39:34.497 --> 00:39:36.457
then you have not
been listening to anything--

00:39:36.541 --> 00:39:39.169
[Kublai] Enough of your insolence!

00:39:40.795 --> 00:39:42.047
You...

00:39:43.756 --> 00:39:46.842
beg for my pardon,
is that your scheme?

00:39:47.886 --> 00:39:51.639
No, Sire.
Begging is for the guilty.

00:39:58.354 --> 00:40:02.525
I've seen stronger men than you
weep before the rug.

00:40:04.069 --> 00:40:07.822
When the time comes,
be brave and sure.

00:40:09.449 --> 00:40:11.701
For it is coming at dawn...

00:40:13.036 --> 00:40:15.288
no matter how loud you cry.

00:40:16.957 --> 00:40:18.959
-Lord Khan--
-[grunts sharply]

00:40:23.504 --> 00:40:25.256
[Kublai slurping]

00:40:51.741 --> 00:40:53.034
[breathes deeply]

00:43:03.331 --> 00:43:04.415
[Kublai] <i>Liar!</i>

00:43:04.499 --> 00:43:05.625
You're a liar!

00:43:06.709 --> 00:43:10.171
Remove yourself.
We speak of this lunacy no more.

00:43:10.255 --> 00:43:11.756
Tell the <i>kheshig</i> to jail me.

00:43:11.839 --> 00:43:15.885
You made your point, take your leave.
There is honest work to be done.

00:43:15.968 --> 00:43:18.638
This is merely a statement of facts.

00:43:18.721 --> 00:43:20.931
Oh! You hired the assassins?

00:43:21.474 --> 00:43:23.684
You manipulated that whore, Mei Lin.

00:43:23.768 --> 00:43:27.605
You instructed my brother
to withhold his troops from Wuchang?

00:43:27.688 --> 00:43:29.232
You conspired with Jia Sidao?

00:43:29.315 --> 00:43:31.609
I conspired for and with the Khanate.

00:43:31.692 --> 00:43:35.280
And you think, what?
The Khanate does not guide my heart?

00:43:35.363 --> 00:43:36.822
Your mind.

00:43:37.490 --> 00:43:40.368
But minds can be easily
persuaded of anything.

00:43:40.451 --> 00:43:44.622
The reason you do not sleep
is because of a longing in your heart

00:43:44.705 --> 00:43:47.500
-that will never be sated.
-And why should it?

00:43:48.209 --> 00:43:51.296
-I know you believe Xiangyang will fall.
-It will.

00:43:51.379 --> 00:43:56.050
And you fear that once conquered,
I turn my aims to lands far reaching?

00:43:56.134 --> 00:43:57.677
-I do.
-[shouting] Why should I not?

00:43:57.760 --> 00:44:00.596
Because you know how this will end.

00:44:01.847 --> 00:44:03.974
As all other dynasties have.

00:44:05.226 --> 00:44:07.187
Am I not different?

00:44:08.271 --> 00:44:10.105
I once believed so.

00:44:10.190 --> 00:44:12.525
It is why I stand before you this evening.

00:44:12.608 --> 00:44:14.735
Yusuf, you did not do this.

00:44:15.653 --> 00:44:17.738
My confession stands.

00:44:17.822 --> 00:44:22.952
Be it betrayal by my hands
or by my heart,

00:44:23.035 --> 00:44:24.662
I am guilty.

00:44:25.788 --> 00:44:27.165
What do you want from me?

00:44:28.708 --> 00:44:30.751
To give up Xiangyang?

00:44:30.835 --> 00:44:33.629
-You know the answer is yes.
-I cannot.

00:44:33.713 --> 00:44:35.423
I know that as well.

00:44:36.716 --> 00:44:38.968
I should hide behind my wall?

00:44:39.051 --> 00:44:41.846
Take pleasure in the present state?

00:44:41.929 --> 00:44:44.932
While away my days
and bury myself here when they're done?

00:44:45.015 --> 00:44:48.269
Where is the fault in that? Hmm?

00:44:48.353 --> 00:44:50.646
How many lands must be reaped?

00:44:51.272 --> 00:44:56.652
How many vaults must be filled
and young spirits extinguished?

00:45:03.284 --> 00:45:05.495
One. One last game.

00:45:13.127 --> 00:45:14.962
Taken the pieces away.

00:45:34.482 --> 00:45:36.317
The boy is guilty.

00:45:39.279 --> 00:45:42.490
His only guilt
is his blind desire for your love.

00:45:53.543 --> 00:45:56.421
You know who he reminds me of?

00:45:57.547 --> 00:46:01.801
Yusuf... my crazed cripple of Khazaria.

00:46:04.094 --> 00:46:06.431
Not in mindless bloodletting...

00:46:07.723 --> 00:46:10.100
but in dedication to your cause.

00:46:12.728 --> 00:46:14.188
He does.

00:46:15.272 --> 00:46:18.693
You need that dedication
at your service

00:46:18.776 --> 00:46:20.736
at all times.

00:46:23.948 --> 00:46:28.536
I am no longer capable of it,
nor am I willing.

00:46:32.790 --> 00:46:37.044
You have the finest engineers
in all the world.

00:46:37.127 --> 00:46:40.506
My final counsel to you
is that you put them to work.

00:46:41.799 --> 00:46:44.552
Construct the Latin's siege engine.

00:46:56.814 --> 00:47:00.985
As your Khan,
I do not accept your confession.

00:47:08.033 --> 00:47:13.038
I have sent messages to every corner of
the kingdom outlining my complicity.

00:47:14.289 --> 00:47:19.044
In doing so, I have weakened your position
before Karakorum and throughout China.

00:47:20.212 --> 00:47:22.923
You will be challenged in the Kurultai.

00:47:23.007 --> 00:47:24.592
You will lose.

00:47:26.093 --> 00:47:27.553
And in that...

00:47:27.637 --> 00:47:30.848
a dream of this place may endure.

00:47:34.394 --> 00:47:36.854
You have no choice, Kublai.

00:47:51.702 --> 00:47:54.580
[birds chirping]

00:47:58.167 --> 00:48:00.377
[inhales deeply]

00:48:35.746 --> 00:48:38.290
I thought I had until dawn.

00:48:50.302 --> 00:48:52.304
The final battle looms.

00:48:53.305 --> 00:48:55.475
Be decisive in your victory.

00:49:05.860 --> 00:49:08.195
You are released from this prison.

00:49:10.906 --> 00:49:12.742
But I am truly free.

00:50:28.025 --> 00:50:29.860
[man shouting faintly]

00:50:33.197 --> 00:50:35.240
[horses galloping]

00:50:40.746 --> 00:50:42.122
[man urging horse]

00:51:00.850 --> 00:51:02.810
[theme music playing]